Package: causalgap
Type: Package
Title: Precision-Weighted Borrowing in Hybrid Trials
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Se Yoon", "Lee", email = "seyoonlee.stat.math@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Evaluate the unrestricted augmented inverse probability weighting
    estimator of a hybrid trial's borrowing target and its gap from the trial
    treatment effect. Return the individual contributions to the efficient
    influence function using supplied conditional means, variances and
    source probabilities.
